{"arm":"candidate","runtime":"released com.integrallis:models-audio:0.5.11 {backend=pure-java, voices=af_heart,bf_isabella,am_puck,bm_fable, graph=onnx_paradee_int8.onnx, phonemizer=misaki-java fba1236, no fallback, onnxDynamicNodes=1311, onnxNodes=2535, onnxOpset=17, onnxOperators=56} via Paradee-8M v1.2","onnxruntimeVersion":null,"intraOpThreads":1,"interOpThreads":1,"model":"onnx/paradee_int8.onnx","phonemeSource":"java misaki port (bundled dictionaries, CMUdict tier, fallback model); public streaming synthesize","voice":"af_heart","voiceIndex":0,"corpus":"harvard-200","pass":2,"noiseSeed":"model default","java":"25.0.3","machine":"Linux 6.8.0-138-generic amd64 8 cpus","sentences":200,"totalAudioSeconds":524.9500000000002,"totalRunSeconds":43.069302954000015,"realTimeMultiple":12.188495378266762,"allFinite":true,"rows":[{"index":0,"text":"The birch canoe slid on the smooth planks.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.287860016,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.287832085,"realTimeFactor":0.10661482074074073,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":1,"text":"Glue the sheet to the dark blue background.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.421135561,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.421118401,"realTimeFactor":0.1559761337037037,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":2,"text":"It's easy to tell the depth of a well.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.204197135,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.204180735,"realTimeFactor":0.081678854,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":3,"text":"These days a chicken leg is a rare dish.","audioSeconds":2.9,"runSeconds":0.226997004,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.226983024,"realTimeFactor":0.07827482896551724,"finite":true,"samples":69600},{"index":4,"text":"Rice is often served in round bowls.","audioSeconds":2.8,"runSeconds":0.23422808,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.23419841,"realTimeFactor":0.08365288571428572,"finite":true,"samples":67200},{"index":5,"text":"The juice of lemons makes fine punch.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.239499065,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.239363274,"realTimeFactor":0.09300934563106796,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":6,"text":"The box was thrown beside the parked truck.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.233557327,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.233540197,"realTimeFactor":0.0865027137037037,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":7,"text":"The hogs were fed chopped corn and garbage.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.236874389,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.236856469,"realTimeFactor":0.08311382070175438,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":8,"text":"Four hours of steady work faced us.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.234252881,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.234114941,"realTimeFactor":0.0918638749019608,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":9,"text":"A large size in stockings is hard to sell.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.3078067,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.307651969,"realTimeFactor":0.10092022950819672,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":10,"text":"The boy was there when the sun rose.","audioSeconds":2.4,"runSeconds":0.239562968,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.239442747,"realTimeFactor":0.09981790333333333,"finite":true,"samples":57600},{"index":11,"text":"A rod is used to catch pink salmon.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.238104258,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.238088618,"realTimeFactor":0.090706384,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":12,"text":"The source of the huge river is the clear spring.","audioSeconds":3.1,"runSeconds":0.243370002,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.243351912,"realTimeFactor":0.07850645225806452,"finite":true,"samples":74400},{"index":13,"text":"Kick the ball straight and follow through.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.212882163,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.212863553,"realTimeFactor":0.08267268466019417,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":14,"text":"Help the woman get back to her feet.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.189344873,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.189322133,"realTimeFactor":0.07808036,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":15,"text":"A pot of tea helps to pass the evening.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.213026837,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.212999197,"realTimeFactor":0.08038748566037736,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":16,"text":"Smoky fires lack flame and heat.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.209626485,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.209604365,"realTimeFactor":0.08140834368932039,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":17,"text":"The soft cushion broke the man's fall.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.21035966,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.21033991,"realTimeFactor":0.0824939843137255,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":18,"text":"The salt breeze came across from the sea.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.209635955,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.209606925,"realTimeFactor":0.07986131619047619,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":19,"text":"The girl at the booth sold fifty bonds.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.212997249,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.212978789,"realTimeFactor":0.08037632037735849,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":20,"text":"The small pup gnawed a hole in the sock.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.208067746,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.208047016,"realTimeFactor":0.08240306772277228,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":21,"text":"The fish twisted and turned on the bent hook.","audioSeconds":2.925,"runSeconds":0.288942473,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.288787432,"realTimeFactor":0.09878375145299145,"finite":true,"samples":70200},{"index":22,"text":"Press the pants and sew a button on the vest.","audioSeconds":3.025,"runSeconds":0.295105913,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.295086783,"realTimeFactor":0.09755567371900827,"finite":true,"samples":72600},{"index":23,"text":"The swan dive was far short of perfect.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.216826204,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.216810354,"realTimeFactor":0.0760793698245614,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":24,"text":"The beauty of the view stunned the young boy.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.281559208,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.281543438,"realTimeFactor":0.10428118814814814,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":25,"text":"Two blue fish swam in the tank.","audioSeconds":2.3,"runSeconds":0.182520311,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.182506881,"realTimeFactor":0.07935665695652173,"finite":true,"samples":55200},{"index":26,"text":"Her purse was full of useless trash.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.203252527,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.203237397,"realTimeFactor":0.07742953409523809,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":27,"text":"The colt reared and threw the tall rider.","audioSeconds":2.825,"runSeconds":0.210640135,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.210623395,"realTimeFactor":0.0745628796460177,"finite":true,"samples":67800},{"index":28,"text":"It snowed, rained, and hailed the same morning.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.295085959,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.295066439,"realTimeFactor":0.09674949475409837,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":29,"text":"Read verse out loud for pleasure.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.198413836,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.198383286,"realTimeFactor":0.08182013855670105,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":30,"text":"Hoist the load to your left shoulder.","audioSeconds":2.35,"runSeconds":0.222674204,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.222659574,"realTimeFactor":0.0947549804255319,"finite":true,"samples":56400},{"index":31,"text":"Take the winding path to reach the lake.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.214275271,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.214258721,"realTimeFactor":0.08162867466666666,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":32,"text":"Note closely the size of the gas tank.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.24160327,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.24157304,"realTimeFactor":0.08785573454545455,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":33,"text":"Wipe the grease off his dirty face.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.213251305,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.213230665,"realTimeFactor":0.08793868247422681,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":34,"text":"Mend the coat before you go out.","audioSeconds":2.25,"runSeconds":0.177726582,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.177711552,"realTimeFactor":0.078989592,"finite":true,"samples":54000},{"index":35,"text":"The wrist was badly strained and hung limp.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.217678004,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.217661443,"realTimeFactor":0.07637824701754387,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":36,"text":"The stray cat gave birth to kittens.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.200384511,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.200367361,"realTimeFactor":0.07633695657142857,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":37,"text":"The young girl gave no clear response.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.211223573,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.211205782,"realTimeFactor":0.07823095296296295,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":38,"text":"The meal was cooked before the bell rang.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.23974405,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.2397188,"realTimeFactor":0.09494813861386138,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":39,"text":"What joy there is in living.","audioSeconds":2.075,"runSeconds":0.1649662,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.16495206,"realTimeFactor":0.07950178313253012,"finite":true,"samples":49800},{"index":40,"text":"A king ruled the state in the early days.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.221252279,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.221236558,"realTimeFactor":0.08045537418181818,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":41,"text":"The ship was torn apart on the sharp reef.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.215798274,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.215782594,"realTimeFactor":0.07992528666666666,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":42,"text":"Sickness kept him home the third week.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.242286248,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.242270978,"realTimeFactor":0.0969144992,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":43,"text":"The wide road shimmered in the hot sun.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.203043261,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.203028711,"realTimeFactor":0.07734981371428572,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":44,"text":"The lazy cow lay in the cool grass.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.200585824,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.200570534,"realTimeFactor":0.0786611074509804,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":45,"text":"Lift the square stone over the fence.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.199608038,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.199588298,"realTimeFactor":0.08404548968421052,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":46,"text":"The rope will bind the seven books at once.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.221310411,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.221292481,"realTimeFactor":0.08121482972477065,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":47,"text":"Hop over the fence and plunge in.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.231610279,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.231572839,"realTimeFactor":0.09550939340206187,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":48,"text":"The friendly gang left the drug store.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.219776652,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.219754812,"realTimeFactor":0.08535015611650484,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":49,"text":"Mesh wire keeps chicks inside.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.191406136,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.191389476,"realTimeFactor":0.07580441029702971,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":50,"text":"The frosty air passed through the coat.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.195090681,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.19507128,"realTimeFactor":0.08214344463157894,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":51,"text":"The crooked maze failed to fool the mouse.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.230730456,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.230714726,"realTimeFactor":0.08789731657142857,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":52,"text":"Adding fast leads to wrong sums.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.19024696,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.19023061,"realTimeFactor":0.076098784,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":53,"text":"The show was a flop from the very start.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.216506953,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.216481433,"realTimeFactor":0.07945209284403669,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":54,"text":"A saw is a tool used for making boards.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.214289968,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.214273037,"realTimeFactor":0.07518946245614035,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":55,"text":"The wagon moved on well oiled wheels.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.216112421,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.216088541,"realTimeFactor":0.08312016192307692,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":56,"text":"March the soldiers past the next hill.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.212753168,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.212736888,"realTimeFactor":0.08028421433962264,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":57,"text":"A cup of sugar makes sweet fudge.","audioSeconds":2.35,"runSeconds":0.215412537,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.215397577,"realTimeFactor":0.09166490936170212,"finite":true,"samples":56400},{"index":58,"text":"Place a rosebush near the porch steps.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.196027669,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.195999059,"realTimeFactor":0.0753952573076923,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":59,"text":"Both lost their lives in the raging storm.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.218388606,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.218371426,"realTimeFactor":0.07662758105263158,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":60,"text":"We talked of the side show in the circus.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.205558124,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.205539784,"realTimeFactor":0.0798283976699029,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":61,"text":"Use a pencil to write the first draft.","audioSeconds":2.775,"runSeconds":0.223211511,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.22319392,"realTimeFactor":0.08043658054054055,"finite":true,"samples":66600},{"index":62,"text":"He ran half way to the hardware store.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.24451992,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.24449614,"realTimeFactor":0.08973208073394495,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":63,"text":"The clock struck to mark the third period.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.207136094,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.207118894,"realTimeFactor":0.07890898819047619,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":64,"text":"A small creek cut across the field.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.188998284,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.188981214,"realTimeFactor":0.07714215673469386,"finite":true,"samples":58800},{"index":65,"text":"Cars and busses stalled in snow drifts.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.230125946,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.230107246,"realTimeFactor":0.08074594596491227,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":66,"text":"The set of china hit the floor with a crash.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.222428936,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.222411825,"realTimeFactor":0.08088324945454545,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":67,"text":"This is a grand season for hikes on the road.","audioSeconds":2.875,"runSeconds":0.243982339,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.243957538,"realTimeFactor":0.08486342226086956,"finite":true,"samples":69000},{"index":68,"text":"The dune rose from the edge of the water.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.218444819,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.218420159,"realTimeFactor":0.0832170739047619,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":69,"text":"Those words were the cue for the actor to leave.","audioSeconds":3.0,"runSeconds":0.226205881,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.226189291,"realTimeFactor":0.07540196033333334,"finite":true,"samples":72000},{"index":70,"text":"A yacht slid around the point into the bay.","audioSeconds":2.775,"runSeconds":0.240442086,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.240425326,"realTimeFactor":0.08664579675675677,"finite":true,"samples":66600},{"index":71,"text":"The two met while playing on the sand.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.200642733,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.200626593,"realTimeFactor":0.0844811507368421,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":72,"text":"The ink stain dried on the finished page.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.21825663,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.21823909,"realTimeFactor":0.08009417614678899,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":73,"text":"The walled town was seized without a fight.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.205844848,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.205828058,"realTimeFactor":0.0799397467961165,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":74,"text":"The lease ran out in sixteen weeks.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.203083111,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.203058851,"realTimeFactor":0.0812332444,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":75,"text":"A tame squirrel makes a nice pet.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.203855066,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.203839296,"realTimeFactor":0.085833712,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":76,"text":"The horn of the car woke the sleeping cop.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.198219339,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.198202609,"realTimeFactor":0.0762382073076923,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":77,"text":"The heart beat strongly and with firm strokes.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.247936668,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.247909238,"realTimeFactor":0.08129071081967214,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":78,"text":"The pearl was worn in a thin silver ring.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.215375174,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.215358234,"realTimeFactor":0.07557023649122807,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":79,"text":"The fruit peel was cut in thick slices.","audioSeconds":2.75,"runSeconds":0.231660021,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.231642771,"realTimeFactor":0.08424000763636363,"finite":true,"samples":66000},{"index":80,"text":"The Navy attacked the big task force.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.208767171,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.208739741,"realTimeFactor":0.07878006452830189,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":81,"text":"See the cat glaring at the scared mouse.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.201714593,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.201696533,"realTimeFactor":0.07684365447619047,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":82,"text":"There are more than two factors here.","audioSeconds":2.325,"runSeconds":0.191034613,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.191019193,"realTimeFactor":0.08216542494623655,"finite":true,"samples":55800},{"index":83,"text":"The hat brim was wide and too droopy.","audioSeconds":2.7,"runSeconds":0.208383669,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.208365239,"realTimeFactor":0.07717913666666666,"finite":true,"samples":64800},{"index":84,"text":"The lawyer tried to lose his case.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.17975628,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.17973538,"realTimeFactor":0.07412630103092784,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":85,"text":"The grass curled around the fence post.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.203493626,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.203477756,"realTimeFactor":0.07902665087378641,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":86,"text":"Cut the pie into large parts.","audioSeconds":2.2,"runSeconds":0.19035981,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.19034272,"realTimeFactor":0.08652718636363635,"finite":true,"samples":52800},{"index":87,"text":"Men strive but seldom get rich.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.208939093,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.208910563,"realTimeFactor":0.08114139533980581,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":88,"text":"Always close the barn door tight.","audioSeconds":2.4,"runSeconds":0.201741527,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.201712407,"realTimeFactor":0.08405896958333334,"finite":true,"samples":57600},{"index":89,"text":"He lay prone and hardly moved a limb.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.217032039,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.217012849,"realTimeFactor":0.07964478495412844,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":90,"text":"The slush lay deep along the street.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.181394413,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.181377333,"realTimeFactor":0.07480181979381444,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":91,"text":"A wisp of cloud hung in the blue air.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.213633085,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.213612655,"realTimeFactor":0.0871971775510204,"finite":true,"samples":58800},{"index":92,"text":"A pound of sugar costs more than eggs.","audioSeconds":2.675,"runSeconds":0.20983116,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.20981316,"realTimeFactor":0.07844155514018691,"finite":true,"samples":64200}